            <ArticleTitle>Premature coronary artery disease in identical male twins studied by selective coronary arteriography.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>91-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Identical twin brothers with premature coronary artery disease are described. Repeat selective cine-coronary arteriograms were performed in this unique twin model and demonstrated a close similarity in location and extent of atherosclerotic lesions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
